        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Teatro Comunale di Bologna, Paris\n- People: Daniel Auber, a leading tenor\n- Works: an opera, Les Rendezvous\n- Topics: premieres, performances, music contribution\n\nFacts:\n- In 1846, an opera was first performed at the Teatro Comunale di Bologna in Paris with a leading tenor.\n- The leading tenor sang in the premiere of an opera featuring music by Daniel Auber.\n- Daniel Auber had previously contributed music to the one-act ballet Les Rendezvous in 1933.",
